      "content": "it's not just being tired though. it feels more permanent than that. like the well didn't just run dry, it's like the ground itself is gone. there's nothing left to refill. i look at the person i used to be and i don't even recognize them. what's the point of trying to 'give back to myself' when there's nothing left to give?",
